1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:09,380
Video ya leo inahusu nini? Utamaduni wa kipekee wa Japani!

2
00:00:09,380 --> 00:00:12,380
Sehemu ya 1: Jinsi ya Kufurahia Sushi ya Mzunguko

3
00:00:12,380 --> 00:00:17,114
Hapa ni mgahawa wa sushi ya mzunguko.

4
00:00:17,137 --> 00:00:21,794
Kuna chakula kingi kinazunguka, sivyo?

5
00:00:21,817 --> 00:00:26,484
Ndiyo, chukua sahani unayopenda na kula.

6
00:00:26,507 --> 00:00:29,782
Mfumo wa kuvutia sana!

7
00:00:29,805 --> 00:00:34,772
Unapotaka kuagiza, tumia skrini hii.

8
00:00:34,795 --> 00:00:38,369
Je, kuna menyu kwa Kiingereza?

9
00:00:38,392 --> 00:00:43,810
Ndiyo, unaweza kubadilisha lugha kwenye skrini.

10
00:00:43,833 --> 00:00:46,500
Hiyo ni rahisi sana!

11
00:00:46,524 --> 00:00:51,491
Mimi napenda samaki wa tuna zaidi.

12
00:00:51,514 --> 00:00:56,714
Mimi si mzuri sana na samaki mbichi.

13
00:00:56,737 --> 00:01:01,816
Kuna sushi ya nyama na hata sushi ya tempura.

14
00:01:01,840 --> 00:01:04,006
Kweli?

15
00:01:04,029 --> 00:01:08,678
Ndiyo, kuna hata sushi ya kamba wa kukaanga.

16
00:01:08,701 --> 00:01:13,101
Hivyo basi, nitaweza kula nyingi.

17
00:01:13,124 --> 00:01:16,531
Tazama mezani hapa.

18
00:01:16,555 --> 00:01:19,642
Kuna vitu vingi tofauti!

19
00:01:19,665 --> 00:01:23,678
Hii ni shoyu (sosi ya soya).

20
00:01:23,701 --> 00:01:26,589
Sanduku hili la kijani ni nini?

21
00:01:26,613 --> 00:01:30,047
Hiyo ni wasabi.

22
00:01:30,070 --> 00:01:34,958
Je, wasabi iko ndani ya sushi?

23
00:01:34,981 --> 00:01:41,181
Hapana, katika mgahawa huu hakuna wasabi ndani ya sushi yote.

24
00:01:41,204 --> 00:01:44,417
Hivyo basi, unaweka wenyewe?

25
00:01:44,440 --> 00:01:49,607
Kule kuna unga wa chai ya kijani, sivyo?

26
00:01:49,630 --> 00:01:52,063
Ndiyo, ipo.

27
00:01:52,086 --> 00:01:56,686
Weka unga kwenye kikombe.

28
00:01:56,709 --> 00:01:59,288
Baada ya hapo nifanye nini?

29
00:01:59,312 --> 00:02:04,245
Bonyeza kitufe kwenye meza kwa nguvu.

30
00:02:04,268 --> 00:02:07,401
Aa! Maji moto yamepatikana.

31
00:02:07,424 --> 00:02:11,258
Jihadhari usije ukajikuna.

32
00:02:11,281 --> 00:02:15,214
Kufanya mwenyewe ni furaha!

33
00:02:15,237 --> 00:02:18,237
Tazama rangi za sahani.

34
00:02:18,260 --> 00:02:22,737
Kuna sahani nyekundu na sahani buluu!

35
00:02:22,761 --> 00:02:26,845
Rangi hutofautisha bei.

36
00:02:26,868 --> 00:02:31,268
Sahani hii buluu ni bei gani?

37
00:02:31,291 --> 00:02:34,906
Hiyo ni mia moja na hamsini shilingi.

38
00:02:34,929 --> 00:02:37,529
Bei rahisi sana!

39
00:02:37,552 --> 00:02:42,286
Aa! Sushi tuliyokuwa tunawaita inakuja!

40
00:02:42,309 --> 00:02:44,999
Inatoka wapi?

41
00:02:45,023 --> 00:02:50,156
Kutoka kwenye njia ya juu, inaletwa na treni ya Shinkansen.

42
00:02:50,179 --> 00:02:52,312
Incredible!

43
00:02:52,335 --> 00:02:57,202
Baada ya kuchukua sahani, bonyeza kitufe kwenye skrini.

44
00:02:57,225 --> 00:03:01,363
Treni ya Shinkansen imerudi.

45
00:03:01,386 --> 00:03:05,353
Sasa, twala wakati bado ni moto.

46
00:03:05,376 --> 00:03:07,455
Tunashukuru.

47
00:03:07,479 --> 00:03:09,846
Je, ni tamu?

48
00:03:09,869 --> 00:03:13,202
Ndiyo, ni tamu sana!

49
00:03:13,225 --> 00:03:17,891
Sahani zilizokwisha kuliwa, ziweke pamoja mezani.

50
00:03:17,914 --> 00:03:21,881
Je, sahani za rangi moja zinawekwa pamoja?

51
00:03:21,904 --> 00:03:28,748
Ndiyo, kama utakusanya sahani za rangi moja, utahesabu kwa urahisi baadaye.

52
00:03:28,771 --> 00:03:30,816
Nimeelewa.

53
00:03:30,840 --> 00:03:36,055
Dukani hapa, unaweza kuweka sahani katika shimo pia.

54
00:03:36,079 --> 00:03:39,055
Shimo la kuweka sahani?

55
00:03:39,078 --> 00:03:44,770
Ndiyo, ukifanya sahani tano, mchezo utaanza.

56
00:03:44,794 --> 00:03:48,727
Kama nitafaulu mchezoni, nitapata kitu?

57
00:03:48,750 --> 00:03:52,837
Nitapata kidogo cha kuchezea.

58
00:03:52,861 --> 00:03:57,061
Inaonekana ya kupendeza, basi tutakula sana.

59
00:03:57,084 --> 00:04:04,189
Kiungo cha kurudia video ya leo kipo kwenye maelezo na maoni ya juu. *Tovuti inaweza kuondolewa bila tahadhari.

60
00:04:04,189 --> 00:04:07,189
Sehemu ya 2: Uvutio wa Sampuli za Chakula

61
00:04:07,189 --> 00:04:12,072
Sasa twende dukani kwa sampuli za chakula.

62
00:04:12,095 --> 00:04:14,270
Sampuli za chakula?

63
00:04:14,293 --> 00:04:20,293
Ndiyo, chakula bandia zinazopatikana mlangoni mwa mikahawa.

64
00:04:20,316 --> 00:04:24,160
Aa, nimeona kwenye televisheni.

65
00:04:24,183 --> 00:04:28,820
Dukani hapa kuna sampuli nyingi.

66
00:04:28,844 --> 00:04:33,977
Waa, spageti hii inaonekana kama halisi!

67
00:04:34,000 --> 00:04:37,615
Uma wingine unasonga hewani.

68
00:04:37,639 --> 00:04:40,447
Kwa nini haanguki?

69
00:04:40,470 --> 00:04:45,716
Kwa sababu sampuli hizi zimefanywa kwa plastiki ngumu.

70
00:04:45,740 --> 00:04:48,155
Ufundi wa ajabu!

71
00:04:48,179 --> 00:04:52,217
Kule kuna sampuli za sushi pia.

72
00:04:52,241 --> 00:04:56,644
Mafuta ya samaki yamefanywa kwa uhalisia mno.

73
00:04:56,667 --> 00:05:01,003
Unaweza kugusa, lakini usivunje.

74
00:05:01,026 --> 00:05:04,560
Kama ukipiga kidogo, ni laini?

75
00:05:04,583 --> 00:05:09,655
Hapana, hii ni plastiki, kwa hivyo ni ngumu.

76
00:05:09,678 --> 00:05:13,278
Kwa macho tu, huwezi kutofautisha kabisa.

77
00:05:13,301 --> 00:05:19,117
Zamani zilifanywa kwa nta, lakini sasa zimetumia vifaa tofauti.

78
00:05:19,141 --> 00:05:21,941
Hivyo basi hazizi.

79
00:05:21,964 --> 00:05:26,254
Ndiyo, hata siku za joto kali, hazihasi.

80
00:05:26,278 --> 00:05:30,045
Nchi za nje hazina sampuli kama hizi.

81
00:05:30,068 --> 00:05:35,886
Kwenye mikahawa ya Japani, unaweza kujua chakula kabla ya kuangalia menyu.

82
00:05:35,910 --> 00:05:40,581
Ni rahisi sana kwa watalii wasioelewa kanji.

83
00:05:40,604 --> 00:05:45,371
Dukani hapa unaweza kujaribu kutengeneza sampuli pia.

84
00:05:45,394 --> 00:05:48,727
Naweza kutengeneza mwenyewe?

85
00:05:48,750 --> 00:05:53,848
Ndiyo, unaweza kutengeneza tempura au saladi.

86
00:05:53,871 --> 00:05:57,769
Inaonekana ya kupendeza, nataka kujaribu pia.

87
00:05:57,793 --> 00:06:02,326
Unaweza kununua vitu vidogo vya kumbukumbu kama zawadi.

88
00:06:02,349 --> 00:06:05,838
Kuna kiungo cha funguo cha ramen.

89
00:06:05,861 --> 00:06:10,733
Nitainunua kiungo cha chupa ndogo ya bia.

90
00:06:10,757 --> 00:06:15,123
Hata povu zimefanywa kwa uhalisia.

91
00:06:15,146 --> 00:06:18,980
Rafiki zako watashangaa kama utawapa zawadi.

92
00:06:19,003 --> 00:06:22,203
Ndiyo, watashangaa sana.

93
00:06:22,226 --> 00:06:26,668
Basi, twende kufanya maagizo ya kufanya sampuli.

94
00:06:26,691 --> 00:06:28,729
Tafadhali.

95
00:06:28,752 --> 00:06:37,691
Kama umeelewa, tafadhali uandike maoni.

96
00:06:37,691 --> 00:06:40,691
Sehemu ya 3: Jinsi ya Kufurahia Mikahawa ya Wanyama

97
00:06:40,691 --> 00:06:44,861
Sasa twende mikahawa ya wanyama.

98
00:06:44,885 --> 00:06:46,924
Mikahawa ya wanyama?

99
00:06:46,947 --> 00:06:53,221
Ndiyo, ni mahali pa kunywa chai wakati wa kuangalia wanyama wapendao.

100
00:06:53,244 --> 00:06:57,729
Japani ina aina nyingi za mikahawa ya wanyama.

101
00:06:57,753 --> 00:07:02,753
Ndiyo, makafé ya paka na mbwa yana umaarufu sana.

102
00:07:02,776 --> 00:07:07,109
Niliona kafé ya mbwa wadogo kwenye televisheni.

103
00:07:07,132 --> 00:07:11,966
Mbwa wadogo ni wadogo sana na wenye kupendeza mno.

104
00:07:11,989 --> 00:07:15,679
Je, kuna makafé ya bundi au kalunguyeye pia?

105
00:07:15,703 --> 00:07:20,371
Ndiyo, hivi sasa yana umaarufu mkubwa sana.

106
00:07:20,395 --> 00:07:25,204
Mimi ninapenda ndege, kwa hivyo nataka kwenda kafé ya bundi.

107
00:07:25,227 --> 00:07:29,505
Basi, twendeni kafé ya bundi iliyo karibu.

108
00:07:29,528 --> 00:07:34,129
Kuna sheria zozote kabla ya kuingia ndani ya duka?

109
00:07:34,153 --> 00:07:38,920
Ndiyo, kwanza fua mikono yako vizuri.

110
00:07:38,943 --> 00:07:42,042
Je, mtapika kwa alkoholi pia?

111
00:07:42,065 --> 00:07:47,065
Ndiyo, ni muhimu kuzuia magonjwa ya wanyama.

112
00:07:47,088 --> 00:07:48,695
Nimeelewa.

113
00:07:48,718 --> 00:07:53,518
Halafu, usizungumze kwa sauti kubwa.

114
00:07:53,541 --> 00:07:56,908
Wanyama watashangaa.

115
00:07:56,931 --> 00:07:59,531
Je, naweza kupiga picha?

116
00:07:59,554 --> 00:08:04,087
Unaweza kupiga picha, lakini usitumie flash.

117
00:08:04,110 --> 00:08:08,477
Mwanga mkali unaweza kuwa mbaya kwa macho ya ndege.

118
00:08:08,500 --> 00:08:11,067
Ndiyo, tutaweka tahadhari.

119
00:08:11,090 --> 00:08:15,023
Kuna bundi mkubwa huko.

120
00:08:15,046 --> 00:08:18,728
Eeh, ni mtulivu na mzuri mno.

121
00:08:18,752 --> 00:08:21,233
Naweza kumnusa?

122
00:08:21,256 --> 00:08:25,509
Bundi huyu mwenye stika ya njano unaweza kumnusa.

123
00:08:25,533 --> 00:08:29,866
Nusa nyuma ya kichwa kwa utulivu.

124
00:08:29,889 --> 00:08:32,742
Ni laini mno unapomnusa.

125
00:08:32,765 --> 00:08:36,015
Bundi amefunga macho.

126
00:08:36,038 --> 00:08:39,238
Anapofurahia, huwa amefunga macho.

127
00:08:39,261 --> 00:08:44,061
Bundi yule kule ana stika ya rangi tofauti.

128
00:08:44,084 --> 00:08:47,418
Bundi mwenye stika nyekundu usimnuse.

129
00:08:47,441 --> 00:08:50,923
Sasa hivi ana hali ya wasiwasi kidogo.

130
00:08:50,946 --> 00:08:55,146
Ndiyo, anaweza kukuroga, kwa hivyo kuwa makini.

131
00:08:55,169 --> 00:08:59,409
Chakula na vinywaji ninunua wapi?

132
00:08:59,432 --> 00:09:03,507
Nunua tiketi kwenye mashine ya kuuza karibu na ingresso.

133
00:09:03,531 --> 00:09:06,098
Kikombe chenye kifuniko, sivyo?

134
00:09:06,121 --> 00:09:10,087
Ndiyo, tumia kifuniko ili manyoya ya ndege yasipate ndani.

135
00:09:10,110 --> 00:09:12,719
Wamefikiria vizuri sana.

136
00:09:12,743 --> 00:09:15,476
Hapa kuna muda uliowekwa.

137
00:09:15,499 --> 00:09:17,943
Muda wa saa moja ni bei gani?

138
00:09:17,966 --> 00:09:20,900
Kila mtu ni shilingi elfu moja na mia tano.

139
00:09:20,923 --> 00:09:23,889
Bei ya kinywaji imejumuishwa.

140
00:09:23,912 --> 00:09:26,346
Nadhani ni bei rahisi.

141
00:09:26,369 --> 00:09:31,135
Nimepona sana, kwa hivyo kesho nitajitahidi katika kazi.

142
00:09:31,158 --> 00:09:34,192
Ndiyo, na tutarudi tena.

143
00:09:34,215 --> 00:09:37,215
Sehemu ya 4: Jinsi ya Kutumia Mashine za Kuuza Kinywaji / Jinsi ya Kutumia Vending Machines nchini Japani

144
00:09:37,215 --> 00:09:42,626
Eeh, kuna mashine nyingi za kuuza kinywaji!

145
00:09:42,649 --> 00:09:47,660
Nchini Japani, zipo katika maeneo mengi.

146
00:09:47,683 --> 00:09:53,360
Nchini kwangu hazipo sana, kwa hivyo ni ajabu sana.

147
00:09:53,383 --> 00:09:58,616
Nina kiu, je, tutanunue kinywaji?

148
00:09:58,639 --> 00:10:00,373
Sawa.

149
00:10:00,396 --> 00:10:01,833
Tunanunue.

150
00:10:01,856 --> 00:10:04,503
Unataka aina gani ya kinywaji?

151
00:10:04,526 --> 00:10:08,464
Ninataka chai baridi.

152
00:10:08,487 --> 00:10:11,498
Tazama chini ya kitufe.

153
00:10:11,522 --> 00:10:16,822
Aa, kuna rangi ya buluu na nyekundu.

154
00:10:16,845 --> 00:10:20,478
Rangi ya buluu ni kwa vinywaji baridi.

155
00:10:20,501 --> 00:10:23,789
Je, rangi nyekundu ni nini?

156
00:10:23,813 --> 00:10:27,618
Rangi nyekundu ni kwa vinywaji vya moto.

157
00:10:27,641 --> 00:10:31,641
Hata wakati wa kiangazi kuna vinywaji vya moto?

158
00:10:31,664 --> 00:10:36,721
Ndiyo, kahawa na chai zipo mwaka mzima.

159
00:10:36,745 --> 00:10:39,522
Hiyo ni nzuri sana!

160
00:10:39,545 --> 00:10:44,413
Wakati wa baridi unaweza kununua supu moto pia.

161
00:10:44,436 --> 00:10:48,603
Je, kuna mashine ya kuuzia supu ya kujitegemea?

162
00:10:48,626 --> 00:10:53,430
Ndiyo, kuna supu ya mahindi na miso shiru.

163
00:10:53,454 --> 00:10:56,287
Ziko ndani ya makopo, ndiyo?

164
00:10:56,310 --> 00:11:01,843
Ndiyo, zinapendwa sana wakati wa baridi kwa sababu zinakuwezesha kupata joto.

165
00:11:01,866 --> 00:11:04,866
Ningependa kujaribu wakati wa baridi.

166
00:11:04,889 --> 00:11:07,456
Kitufe cha chai ni kipi?

167
00:11:07,479 --> 00:11:11,012
Kitufe hiki cha mkebe wa kijani.

168
00:11:11,035 --> 00:11:15,235
Ndiyo, bei yake ni mia sita na sitini shilingi.

169
00:11:15,258 --> 00:11:18,066
Pesa zinazowekwa wapi?

170
00:11:18,089 --> 00:11:22,302
Hapa kuna mahali pa kuweka noti.

171
00:11:22,326 --> 00:11:25,621
Mahali pa sarafu ni upande wa kulia, ndiyo?

172
00:11:25,644 --> 00:11:28,010
Ndiyo, ndivyo.

173
00:11:28,033 --> 00:11:31,967
Hivi sasa unaweza kununua kwa kutumia simu ya mkononi?

174
00:11:31,990 --> 00:11:36,790
Ndiyo, unaweza kununua kwa urahisi kwa kutumia programu.

175
00:11:36,813 --> 00:11:40,146
Hata bila pesa taslimu unaweza, basi?

176
00:11:40,169 --> 00:11:44,624
Sasa weka pesa na ubonyeze kitufe.

177
00:11:44,648 --> 00:11:47,126
Ndiyo, nimebonyeza.

178
00:11:47,149 --> 00:11:51,482
Kinywaji kimetoka chini, ndiyo?

179
00:11:51,505 --> 00:11:54,339
Ilisikika sauti kubwa ya 'gachan'.

180
00:11:54,362 --> 00:11:57,768
Usisahau kuchukua pesa zako za mchango.

181
00:11:57,791 --> 00:12:00,591
Aa, karibu sana nilisahau!

182
00:12:00,614 --> 00:12:05,032
Kando ya mashine ya kujitegemea kuna sanduku la mraba, ndiyo?

183
00:12:05,055 --> 00:12:07,022
Ndiyo, ipo.

184
00:12:07,045 --> 00:12:11,982
Hicho ni kisanduku cha takataka kama makopo tupu na chupa za plastiki.

185
00:12:12,006 --> 00:12:15,412
Baada ya kunywa nitaziweka huko, ndiyo?

186
00:12:15,435 --> 00:12:19,235
Ndiyo, usitupe takataka barabarani.

187
00:12:19,258 --> 00:12:21,073
Nimeelewa.

188
00:12:21,097 --> 00:12:23,430
Nitafuata adabu.

189
00:12:23,453 --> 00:12:26,453
Sehemu ya 5: Furaha ya Karaoke

190
00:12:26,453 --> 00:12:30,686
Leo tumekuja katika karoake boksi.

191
00:12:30,709 --> 00:12:34,509
Waa, kuna vyumba vingi sana!

192
00:12:34,532 --> 00:12:39,766
Ndiyo, hapa ni mahali pa kuimba nyimbo.

193
00:12:39,789 --> 00:12:45,922
Hii ni mara yangu ya kwanza kuimba karaoke ya Kijapani, ninafurahia sana!

194
00:12:45,945 --> 00:12:52,217
Tumepokea namba ya chumba kwenye ukaguzi, twende ndani.

195
00:12:52,240 --> 00:12:57,007
Kuna skrini kubwa ndani ya chumba hiki, ndiyo?

196
00:12:57,030 --> 00:13:01,929
Ndiyo, maneno ya wimbo yanaonekana kwenye skrini hiyo.

197
00:13:01,953 --> 00:13:06,720
Kifaa kidogo kwenye meza ni nini?

198
00:13:06,743 --> 00:13:12,676
Hicho kinaitwa 'denmoku', ni kifaa cha kuchagua nyimbo.

199
00:13:12,699 --> 00:13:16,099
Je, kuna nyimbo za Kiingereza au Kivietinamu?

200
00:13:16,122 --> 00:13:21,988
Ndiyo, unaweza kubadilisha lugha kwa kitufe kwenye skrini.

201
00:13:22,011 --> 00:13:27,045
Basi, nitaweza kuimba nyimbo za nchi yangu pia!

202
00:13:27,068 --> 00:13:32,270
Chagua wimbo unayotaka kuimba na ubonyeze kitufe cha kutuma.

203
00:13:32,293 --> 00:13:36,026
Aa, jina la wimbo limeonekana kwenye skrini.

204
00:13:36,049 --> 00:13:41,449
Mkono wako wa mikروفoni, uweke huko na uimbe.

205
00:13:41,472 --> 00:13:45,639
Ninahisi kidogo aibu, lakini nitajaribu kuimba.

206
00:13:45,662 --> 00:13:50,875
Sauti ikiwa kubwa mno, tumia kitufe hiki ili kupunguza.

207
00:13:50,899 --> 00:13:52,866
Nimeelewa.

208
00:13:52,889 --> 00:13:56,692
Je, tunaweza kupunguza taa za chumba pia?

209
00:13:56,715 --> 00:14:01,812
Ndiyo, kwa kuzima swichi kwenye ukuta unaweza kubadilisha mwanga.

210
00:14:01,835 --> 00:14:04,669
Hii imekuwa na hali nzuri, sivyo?

211
00:14:04,692 --> 00:14:09,092
Oo, kuna menyu juu ya meza.

212
00:14:09,115 --> 00:14:13,481
Kuna chakula na vinywaji vingi hapa!

213
00:14:13,504 --> 00:14:16,802
Chipsi za kukaanga na pizza zina umaarufu mkubwa.

214
00:14:16,826 --> 00:14:19,678
Tunapokuwa na hamu ya kuagiza, tunafanya nini?

215
00:14:19,701 --> 00:14:23,678
Tumia simu nyeusi iliyo kwenye ukuta.

216
00:14:23,702 --> 00:14:27,269
Je, mfanyakazi wa mgahawa atatuletea chakula hapa ndani?

217
00:14:27,292 --> 00:14:32,692
Ndiyo, atafungua mlango na kukuletea.

218
00:14:32,715 --> 00:14:35,563
Hii ni mfumo wa ajabu sana!

219
00:14:35,586 --> 00:14:41,924
Nchini Japani, kuna utamaduni uitwao 'Hitora' ambapo watu huja peke yao.

220
00:14:41,947 --> 00:14:45,080
Unakuja peke yako kwa karaoke?

221
00:14:45,103 --> 00:14:51,336
Ndiyo, hapa unaweza kufanya mazoezi mengi bila kushughulikia watu wengine.

222
00:14:51,359 --> 00:14:54,334
Inaonekana kuwa njia nzuri ya kupunguza msongo wa mawazo pia.

223
00:14:54,358 --> 00:14:59,358
Ndiyo, kuimba kwa sauti kubwa kunakufanya usikie vizuri.

224
00:14:59,381 --> 00:15:02,914
Mara inayofuata nitajaribu kuja peke yangu.

225
00:15:02,937 --> 00:15:06,414
Karibu muda wa kuondoka umefika.

226
00:15:06,438 --> 00:15:10,378
Je, kuna ishara yoyote kabla ya muda kuisha?

227
00:15:10,401 --> 00:15:15,887
Ndiyo, simu ya chumba italia dakika kumi kabla ya muda kuisha.

228
00:15:15,910 --> 00:15:20,315
Je, watasema kwamba muda umebaki dakika kumi?

229
00:15:20,338 --> 00:15:24,576
Ndiyo, kwa hiyo utapata taarifa ya muda.

230
00:15:24,599 --> 00:15:27,799
Sasa, twendeni pamoja kuimba wimbo mmoja.

231
00:15:27,822 --> 00:15:29,507
Sawa.

232
00:15:29,531 --> 00:15:32,498
Twendeni kuimba wimbo wa katuni.

233
00:15:32,521 --> 00:15:37,170
Baada ya kuimba, tutalipa pesa pamoja kwenye ukaguzi.

234
00:15:37,193 --> 00:15:40,193
Sehemu ya 6: Utangulizi wa Pachinko

235
00:15:40,193 --> 00:15:43,827
Hii ni duka la Pachinko, sivyo?

236
00:15:43,850 --> 00:15:50,016
Ndiyo, ni mahali kama ukumbi mkubwa wa michezo wa kipekee wa Japani.

237
00:15:50,039 --> 00:15:54,618
Hata nje ya duka unaweza kusikia sauti nyingi.

238
00:15:54,641 --> 00:15:58,008
Ndani ya duka sauti ni kubwa zaidi.

239
00:15:58,031 --> 00:16:03,564
Mlango ukifunguka, unaweza kuona mianga mingi ya kutamanisha.

240
00:16:03,587 --> 00:16:07,954
Ndiyo, kuna mashine nyingi zilizopangwa.

241
00:16:07,977 --> 00:16:12,710
Je, mtu kama mimi kutoka nchi nyingine anaweza kucheza?

242
00:16:12,733 --> 00:16:18,710
Ndiyo, mtu yeyote aliye na umri wa miaka kumi na minane na zaidi anaweza kucheza.

243
00:16:18,734 --> 00:16:20,216
Sawa kabisa!

244
00:16:20,239 --> 00:16:22,715
Tunacheza vipi?

245
00:16:22,739 --> 00:16:26,626
Kwanza, keti kwenye kiti kilicho wazi.

246
00:16:26,650 --> 00:16:30,883
Baada ya hapo, je, naweka pesa kwenye mashine?

247
00:16:30,906 --> 00:16:32,401
Ndiyo.

248
00:16:32,425 --> 00:16:36,492
Ukiweka noti, pesa zitatumika.

249
00:16:36,515 --> 00:16:39,004
Baada ya hapo, nifanye nini?

250
00:16:39,027 --> 00:16:42,295
Bonyeza kitufe cha kukodisha mipira.

251
00:16:42,319 --> 00:16:46,852
Aa, mipira midogo ya fedha imetoka mingi!

252
00:16:46,875 --> 00:16:49,853
Mipira hiyo ndiyo utatumia kucheza.

253
00:16:49,877 --> 00:16:54,244
Kipande cha mviringo chini kulia ni nini?

254
00:16:54,267 --> 00:16:59,134
Ukikigeuza kulia, mpira utapanda juu.

255
00:16:59,156 --> 00:17:04,026
Ukigeuza kwa nguvu tofauti, mpira utapanda mahali tofauti.

256
00:17:04,050 --> 00:17:08,061
Ee, tafuta vizuri mahali unapopiga.

257
00:17:08,084 --> 00:17:11,018
Nambari kwenye skrini zinazunguka.

258
00:17:11,041 --> 00:17:15,807
Tiki katika shimo la kati, skrini itaanza kusonga.

259
00:17:15,830 --> 00:17:19,964
Kama nambari tatu sawa zinafanana, itakuwaje?

260
00:17:19,987 --> 00:17:24,086
Hiyo ni jackpot! Mipira mingi itatoka.

261
00:17:24,110 --> 00:17:28,310
Waa, hiyo inaonekana furaha sana!

262
00:17:28,333 --> 00:17:32,533
Lakini usitumie pesa nyingi mno, sawa?

263
00:17:32,556 --> 00:17:36,135
Ndiyo, nitapanga muda wa kucheza.

264
00:17:36,158 --> 00:17:39,806
Wakati wa kumaliza, bonyeza kitufe cha kurudisha.

265
00:17:39,830 --> 00:17:42,696
Kadi yenye pesa iliyobaki imetoka.

266
00:17:42,719 --> 00:17:48,207
Ee, weka kadi hiyo kwenye mashine ya malipo, pesa zitarudishwa.

267
00:17:48,231 --> 00:17:51,068
Mipira iliyotoka itafanyaje?

268
00:17:51,091 --> 00:17:55,458
Mipira huweka kwenye sanduku au kuhesabiwa kwa mashine.

269
00:17:55,481 --> 00:17:59,014
Baada ya hapo, naweza kupata zawadi?

270
00:17:59,037 --> 00:18:04,637
Ndiyo, badilisha na vitu kama chakula au kalamu kwenye kaunta ya zawadi.

271
00:18:04,660 --> 00:18:07,867
Zawadi za kipekee za kumbukumbu, kweli!

272
00:18:07,891 --> 00:18:11,524
Umepata kufanya uzoefu wa utamaduni maalum wa Japani!

273
00:18:11,547 --> 00:18:15,219
Ndiyo, uzoefu mzuri sana ulikuwa.

274
00:18:15,243 --> 00:18:18,243
Sehemu ya 7: Jinsi ya Kutumia Kafé ya Manga / Jinsi ya Kutumia Kafé ya Manga

275
00:18:18,243 --> 00:18:21,724
Hapa ni kafé ya manga, ndiyo?

276
00:18:21,747 --> 00:18:26,014
Ee, pia huitwa kafe ya intaneti.

277
00:18:26,037 --> 00:18:29,603
Kuna vitabu vingi hapa!

278
00:18:29,626 --> 00:18:35,026
Ndiyo, unaweza kusoma manga zote hapa.

279
00:18:35,049 --> 00:18:40,816
Napenda sana manga za Japani, ninafurahi sana!

280
00:18:40,839 --> 00:18:44,246
Umepokea kadi kwenye ukaguzi?

281
00:18:44,269 --> 00:18:47,403
Ndiyo, nimepokea kadi hii.

282
00:18:47,426 --> 00:18:50,900
Nambari ya chumba imeandikwa hapa.

283
00:18:50,924 --> 00:18:53,490
Chumba cha tatu, ndiyo?

284
00:18:53,513 --> 00:18:56,913
Ee, twende pamoja.

285
00:18:56,936 --> 00:19:01,831
Aa, hiki ni chumba cha binafsi kidogo!

286
00:19:01,855 --> 00:19:05,488
Ndiyo, unaweza kulifunga kwa ufunguo pia.

287
00:19:05,511 --> 00:19:09,357
Kuna kompyuta na kiti kikubwa pia.

288
00:19:09,381 --> 00:19:14,614
Kiti hiki kinaweza kubadilika kuwa kitanda, unaweza kulala pia.

289
00:19:14,637 --> 00:19:17,848
Kuna watu wanaolala hapa?

290
00:19:17,872 --> 00:19:22,321
Ndiyo, watu wengi wanatumia badala ya hoteli.

291
00:19:22,345 --> 00:19:25,025
Bei ni kiasi gani?

292
00:19:25,049 --> 00:19:28,922
Kama miaka mitatu ni elfu moja na mia tano yenye.

293
00:19:28,945 --> 00:19:32,578
Ni rahisi sana kuliko hoteli!

294
00:19:32,601 --> 00:19:37,269
Nina kiu, twende kuchukua kinywaji.

295
00:19:37,293 --> 00:19:39,929
Tununuaje vinywaji?

296
00:19:39,953 --> 00:19:44,793
Vinywaji vyote kwenye kona hiyo ni bure.

297
00:19:44,816 --> 00:19:48,550
Ee, si lazima kulipa?

298
00:19:48,573 --> 00:19:52,856
Ndiyo, soda na kahawa zote ni bure.

299
00:19:52,879 --> 00:19:55,713
Mfumo mzuri sana!

300
00:19:55,736 --> 00:19:59,613
Kuna aiskrimu pia, kula.

301
00:19:59,636 --> 00:20:02,916
Naweza kula wakati nasoma manga?

302
00:20:02,940 --> 00:20:07,307
Ndiyo, unaweza kuleta chumbani.

303
00:20:07,330 --> 00:20:10,167
Kuna chumba cha kuoga?

304
00:20:10,191 --> 00:20:14,457
Ndiyo, kulipa pesa kwenye ukaguzi ili uweze kutumia.

305
00:20:14,480 --> 00:20:17,514
Kuna taulo na mswaki wa meno?

306
00:20:17,537 --> 00:20:21,029
Ndiyo, unaweza kununua madukani.

307
00:20:21,052 --> 00:20:24,121
Kweli, kuna kila kitu hapa!

308
00:20:24,145 --> 00:20:27,578
Tafadhali kimya ndani ya chumba.

309
00:20:27,601 --> 00:20:31,201
Nitazungumza kwa kutumia headphones nikitazama kompyuta.

310
00:20:31,224 --> 00:20:34,697
Ndiyo, usitoe sauti kubwa.

311
00:20:34,720 --> 00:20:38,328
Haitawasumbua watu wa chumba jirani.

312
00:20:38,352 --> 00:20:42,289
Sasa basi, tusome manga nyingi tunazozipenda!

313
00:20:42,313 --> 00:20:45,392
Nitaishi hapa mpaka usiku.

314
00:20:45,415 --> 00:20:48,415
Sehemu ya 8: Furaha ya Kula Yakiniku Peke Yako / Jinsi ya Kufurahia Yakiniku kwa Peke Yako

315
00:20:48,415 --> 00:20:52,884
Hapa ni mgahawa maalum wa watu wanaokula peke yao, ya yakiniku.

316
00:20:52,907 --> 00:20:59,123
Ndiyo, ni mgahawa ambapo unaweza kula yakiniku kwa utulivu peke yako.

317
00:20:59,147 --> 00:21:03,880
Kwenye ingilio la duka kuna mashine ya kuuza vitu otomatiki.

318
00:21:03,903 --> 00:21:08,319
Ndiyo, hapa ndipo unapokata tiketi ya kwanza.

319
00:21:08,342 --> 00:21:12,942
Nimenunua tiketi ya seti ya kalbi.

320
00:21:12,966 --> 00:21:17,499
Sasa basi, tupitie ndani na kuketi kwenye viti.

321
00:21:17,522 --> 00:21:22,979
Aa, viti vimegawanywa moja-moja.

322
00:21:23,003 --> 00:21:30,570
Ndiyo, hawatakuona watu wa karibu, kwa hivyo unaweza kula kwa urahisi wako.

323
00:21:30,593 --> 00:21:34,326
Kwenye meza kuna jiko dogo.

324
00:21:34,349 --> 00:21:38,404
Hiyo ni mashine ya yakiniku kwa ajili ya mtu mmoja.

325
00:21:38,428 --> 00:21:42,028
Unaweza kuwasha moto mwenyewe?

326
00:21:42,051 --> 00:21:47,051
Ndiyo, bonyeza kitufe kilicho karibu nawe ili kuwasha moto.

327
00:21:47,074 --> 00:21:50,944
Kuna skrini ya kugusa mbele yako.

328
00:21:50,967 --> 00:21:57,101
Ndiyo, unaweza kuamua nyama zaidi au kiwango cha mchele.

329
00:21:57,124 --> 00:22:02,257
Ninataka mchele mwingi.

330
00:22:02,280 --> 00:22:06,748
Bonyeza kitufe cha mchele kwenye skrini.

331
00:22:06,772 --> 00:22:11,705
Je, nchini Japani kuna watu wengi wanaokula yakiniku peke yao?

332
00:22:11,728 --> 00:22:15,134
Ndiyo, wako wengi sana.

333
00:22:15,157 --> 00:22:21,030
Nchini kwangu, sisi huwa tunakula yakiniku pamoja na familia au marafiki.

334
00:22:21,054 --> 00:22:25,721
Nchini Japani kuna neno 'ohitorisama'.

335
00:22:25,744 --> 00:22:28,425
'Ohitorisama' ni nini?

336
00:22:28,448 --> 00:22:34,136
Ni watu wanaofurahia kula nje au kusafiri peke yao.

337
00:22:34,160 --> 00:22:37,361
Kula peke yako siyo utupu?

338
00:22:37,385 --> 00:22:44,658
Hapana, unaweza kula kile unachokipenda wakati wako, ni rahisi.

339
00:22:44,681 --> 00:22:50,081
Hivi majuzi, ni kawaida kwenda ramen au karaoke peke yako.

340
00:22:50,104 --> 00:22:56,471
Ndiyo, nchini Japani ni utamaduni wa kufanya mambo peke yako.

341
00:22:56,493 --> 00:23:00,660
Huna haja ya kuwaza macho ya watu wengine.

342
00:23:00,683 --> 00:23:06,816
Aa, seti ya nyama imetoka chini ya kaunta!

343
00:23:06,839 --> 00:23:09,906
Nyama hii inaonekana kuwa tamu sana!

344
00:23:09,929 --> 00:23:13,562
Pamoja na hiyo, kuna sahani ya mchuzi.

345
00:23:13,586 --> 00:23:16,819
Mchuzi uko wapi?

346
00:23:16,842 --> 00:23:21,677
Mbele ya kiti chako kuna chupa za aina mbalimbali za mchuzi.

347
00:23:21,700 --> 00:23:26,034
Kuna mchuzi wa soya na pia maji ya limau.

348
00:23:26,057 --> 00:23:31,063
Ndiyo, tumia mchuzi unaoupenda kwa uhuru.

349
00:23:31,086 --> 00:23:34,331
Sasa basi, tujaribu kuchoma nyama.

350
00:23:34,354 --> 00:23:39,488
Tumia tongs na uweke nyama juu ya wavu.

351
00:23:39,511 --> 00:23:43,077
Inatoa sauti nzuri ya 'juu'.

352
00:23:43,100 --> 00:23:46,834
Usichome nyama mno.

353
00:23:46,857 --> 00:23:49,657
Sawa, nitageuza.

354
00:23:49,680 --> 00:23:54,317
Kuchoma nyama kwa ajili yako mwenyewe ni anasa.

355
00:23:54,340 --> 00:23:59,590
Ndiyo, hakuna mtu atakayekuchukua nyama yako, ni furaha!

356
00:23:59,614 --> 00:24:03,380
Kula nyama pamoja na wali.

357
00:24:03,403 --> 00:24:08,003
Mchuzi huu ni mnono sana na unalingana vizuri na wali.

358
00:24:08,026 --> 00:24:14,267
Ukifanya wavu kuwa chafu, unaweza kuomba kubadilisha kwa kugusa skrini ya kidigitali.

359
00:24:14,291 --> 00:24:18,185
Hata bila kumuita mhudumu, unaweza kufanya kila kitu, sivyo?

360
00:24:18,209 --> 00:24:23,076
Ndiyo, unaweza kufurahia wakati wako peke yako kabisa.

361
00:24:23,099 --> 00:24:26,335
Leo nimeshiba sana.

362
00:24:26,358 --> 00:24:31,158
Baada ya kula, chukua tiketi ya umeme na malizia kwenye kasa.

363
00:24:31,182 --> 00:24:33,553
Asante kwa chakula.

364
00:24:33,576 --> 00:24:36,576
Sehemu ya 9: Jinsi ya Kutumia Hoteli ya Kapsul

365
00:24:36,576 --> 00:24:41,377
Leo tutalala katika hoteli ya kapsul.

366
00:24:41,401 --> 00:24:47,401
Ndiyo, hii ni aina ya hoteli ya kuvutia ambayo ni ya kipekee ya Japani.

367
00:24:47,423 --> 00:24:51,037
Je, tunapaswa kuvua viatu kwenye ingresso?

368
00:24:51,061 --> 00:24:55,752
Ndiyo, vua viatu na uweke kwenye kabati la kuweka vitu.

369
00:24:55,775 --> 00:24:57,813
Nimeelewa.

370
00:24:57,837 --> 00:25:00,046
Nimefunga ufunguo.

371
00:25:00,069 --> 00:25:04,236
Chukua ule ufunguo na nenda kwenye resepsheni.

372
00:25:04,259 --> 00:25:08,192
Hapa ndipo tutakapofanya check-in.

373
00:25:08,215 --> 00:25:12,582
Ndiyo, lipa pesa na upokee ufunguo.

374
00:25:12,605 --> 00:25:18,102
Nambari ya ufunguo wangu ni mia mbili na moja.

375
00:25:18,125 --> 00:25:22,258
Mimi nimepokea ufunguo wa nambari mia tatu na moja.

376
00:25:22,281 --> 00:25:26,252
Kwa nini ghorofa za vyumba zetu ni tofauti?

377
00:25:26,276 --> 00:25:33,943
Kwa sababu hoteli ya kapsul ina maeneo tofauti kabisa kwa wanaume na wanawake.

378
00:25:33,966 --> 00:25:38,776
Aisee, je hatuwezi kwenda ghorofa moja pamoja?

379
00:25:38,799 --> 00:25:42,775
Hapana, hata lifti ni tofauti.

380
00:25:42,798 --> 00:25:47,265
Hatuwezi kuingia ghorofa nyingine.

381
00:25:47,288 --> 00:25:53,121
Ndiyo, bila kadi ya ufunguo, lifti haiendi.

382
00:25:53,145 --> 00:25:57,583
Hii ni mfumo salama sana na mzuri.

383
00:25:57,606 --> 00:26:03,606
Ndiyo, kwa hiyo wanawake wanaweza kulala bila wasiwasi.

384
00:26:03,629 --> 00:26:10,799
Ingawa katika maisha halisi, katika muundo wa video hii tuko pamoja safarini.

385
00:26:10,823 --> 00:26:12,956
Aa, ndivyo.

386
00:26:12,979 --> 00:26:16,861
Hii ni madai ya meta katika maandishi.

387
00:26:16,884 --> 00:26:21,531
Katika hoteli halisi, hapa ndipo tunapoaga.

388
00:26:21,554 --> 00:26:27,088
Ndiyo, toka hapa tutaingia ndani kwa njia tofauti.

389
00:26:27,111 --> 00:26:30,119
Je, ndani ya kapsul ni kimya?

390
00:26:30,142 --> 00:26:34,109
Ndiyo, kila mtu analala kimya.

391
00:26:34,131 --> 00:26:37,739
Hatuwezi kuzungumza kwa sauti kubwa.

392
00:26:37,763 --> 00:26:43,258
Ndiyo, hata sauti ya kengele au simu haitakiwi.

393
00:26:43,281 --> 00:26:46,571
Sharti utumie headphones.

394
00:26:46,595 --> 00:26:49,828
Tutakweka mizigo wapi?

395
00:26:49,851 --> 00:26:54,418
Kuna kabati kubwa, weka huko.

396
00:26:54,441 --> 00:26:58,642
Kuna nguo na taulo ndani ya kabati pia.

397
00:26:58,665 --> 00:27:01,870
Je, kuna ufunguo ndani ya kapsul?

398
00:27:01,894 --> 00:27:07,033
Hapana, mlango wa kapsul una blind tu.

399
00:27:07,057 --> 00:27:10,347
Hatuwezi kufunga ufunguo.

400
00:27:10,371 --> 00:27:16,258
Ndiyo, kwa hiyo weka vitu muhimu kwenye kasha ndogo ya fedha.

401
00:27:16,281 --> 00:27:19,721
Nimeelewa, nitahadhari.

402
00:27:19,745 --> 00:27:23,711
Kuna bafu kubwa ya umma.

403
00:27:23,734 --> 00:27:28,136
Huko unaweza kuondoa uchovu wa safari.

404
00:27:28,160 --> 00:27:33,726
Ndiyo, kuna sauna pia, inafaa sana.

405
00:27:33,749 --> 00:27:38,321
Basi, tutaonana kesho asubuhi kwenye lobi.

406
00:27:38,345 --> 00:27:41,945
Ndiyo, pumzika vizuri.

407
00:27:41,968 --> 00:27:44,041
Usiku mwema.

408
00:27:44,065 --> 00:27:47,065
Mchezo wa 10: Uzoefu wa Furaha katika Maid Cafe / Matukio ya Furaha katika Maid Cafe

409
00:27:47,065 --> 00:27:48,270
V.

410
00:27:48,294 --> 00:27:51,894
Hii ni Maid Cafe, sivyo?

411
00:27:51,916 --> 00:27:57,050
Ndiyo, ni kafe ya kipekee ya Japani yenye mvuto wa kipekee.

412
00:27:57,073 --> 00:28:01,350
Kwenye lango, mhudumu ameanza kupunga mkono.

413
00:28:01,373 --> 00:28:06,657
Ndiyo, ukitaka kuingia, kuna salamu ya ajabu.

414
00:28:06,681 --> 00:28:09,081
Salamu ya namna gani?

415
00:28:09,104 --> 00:28:14,981
Wanasema, 'Karibu nyumbani, bibi yangu, bwana wangu.'

416
00:28:15,004 --> 00:28:18,771
Waa, waliisema kweli!

417
00:28:18,794 --> 00:28:23,327
Ina aibu kidogo, lakini ni ya furaha.

418
00:28:23,350 --> 00:28:26,384
Ndiyo, ni uzoefu wa kuvutia.

419
00:28:26,407 --> 00:28:30,140
Kwanza, tuwasikilize sheria za duka.

420
00:28:30,163 --> 00:28:34,763
Haupaswi kupiga picha za wahudumu bila ruhusa.

421
00:28:34,786 --> 00:28:39,359
Ndiyo, kuna alama ya kamera yenye alama ya '×'.

422
00:28:39,382 --> 00:28:43,121
Kugusa wahudumu pia ni marufuku.

423
00:28:43,145 --> 00:28:47,378
Ndiyo, tunahitaji kuzingatia adabu.

424
00:28:47,401 --> 00:28:51,134
Mhudumu ameleta menyu.

425
00:28:51,157 --> 00:28:54,924
Kare na omuraisu ni maarufu sana.

426
00:28:54,947 --> 00:28:58,280
Nitachagua omuraisu.

427
00:28:58,303 --> 00:29:02,784
Mhudumu atatupiga picha kwa ketchup kwa ajili yetu.

428
00:29:02,807 --> 00:29:05,077
Unataka picha ya nini?

429
00:29:05,101 --> 00:29:09,034
Tujaribu kuomba picha ya paka mzuri.

430
00:29:09,057 --> 00:29:12,824
Samahani, naomba picha ya paka.

431
00:29:12,847 --> 00:29:17,502
Mhudumu anapiga picha vizuri sana.

432
00:29:17,525 --> 00:29:21,981
Tulikuwa tunasikia kama kuna jambo tunalofanya kabla ya kula.

433
00:29:22,004 --> 00:29:27,449
Ndiyo, tutasema maneno ya uchawi ili chakula kiwe ladha.

434
00:29:27,473 --> 00:29:30,546
Maneno ya uchawi?

435
00:29:30,569 --> 00:29:36,302
Sema, 'Kiwe ladha, moe moe kyun!'

436
00:29:36,325 --> 00:29:39,525
Je, tutafanya pozi pamoja na mhudumu?

437
00:29:39,549 --> 00:29:44,549
Ndiyo, fanya mfano wa moyo kwa mikono yako.

438
00:29:44,572 --> 00:29:48,105
Ina aibu kidogo, lakini nitaijaribu.

439
00:29:48,128 --> 00:29:51,561
Tumefahamu vizuri, sasa tuanze kula.

440
00:29:51,584 --> 00:29:53,918
Ladha ikoje?

441
00:29:53,941 --> 00:29:59,397
Ni omuraisu ya kawaida, lakini hisia zangu ni za furaha sana.

442
00:29:59,420 --> 00:30:02,511
Ukumbi ule ni nini?

443
00:30:02,534 --> 00:30:08,539
Wakati fulani, wahudumu wanaimba na kucheza.

444
00:30:08,563 --> 00:30:11,445
Je, tunaweza kuona maonyesho yao?

445
00:30:11,469 --> 00:30:17,248
Ndiyo, ukinunua tiketi, unaweza kupiga picha nao pia.

446
00:30:17,271 --> 00:30:20,279
Cheki ni picha ndogo, sivyo?

447
00:30:20,303 --> 00:30:23,980
Ndiyo, itakuwa kumbukumbu nzuri.

448
00:30:24,004 --> 00:30:28,237
Utamaduni wa otaku wa Japani ni wa kina sana.

449
00:30:28,260 --> 00:30:33,693
Ni maarufu sana kwa wageni, na leo tumekuwa na furaha kuja.

450
00:30:33,716 --> 00:30:37,718
Ndiyo, imekuwa kumbukumbu nzuri.